        </h1>
        <p class="hero-subtext" style="margin: 0 auto 12px; max-width: 780px;">
          Decipher planetary transits, Nakshatra movements, and Vedic numerology across equities, precious metals, energy, commodities, real estate, and digital assets. Personal guidance by celebrity astrologer <strong>Dr. Ashish Patni</strong>.
        </p>
        <div class="trust-calculation-banner" style="max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 14px;">
          <span class="trust-icon">⚖️</span>
          <span class="trust-text"><strong>Multi-Asset Scope:</strong> Authentic Geocentric Ephemeris • 0.001° Sidereal Precision • Personal Horoscope Wealth Timing</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-cta-group" style="justify-content: center; margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px;">
          <a href="#birthCoordinatesFront" class="btn btn-gold btn-lg">
            <span>✨ Enter Your Birth Coordinates</span>
            <span class="btn-arrow">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
          <a href="#drAshishPrestigeSection" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg" style="border-color: rgba(245, 190, 72, 0.6); color: var(--gold-400);">
            <span>👑 Dr. Ashish Patni (VIP Guidance)</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/market-data" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">
            <span>📊 Multi-Asset Dashboard</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Authentic 3D Geocentric Observatory Hero Stage -->
      <div class="hero-orbit-card hero-orbit-fullscreen" id="heroOrbitCard">
        <div class="orbit-card-header">
          <div class="header-left-meta">
            <span class="orbit-status-radar">
              <span class="orbit-status-dot" id="observatoryStatusDot"></span>
            </span>
            <span class="orbit-status-title" id="observatoryModeLabel">Live Sky (Sidereal Lahiri)</span>
            <span class="sse-live-indicator" id="sseLiveIndicator" title="SSE Telemetry Stream (0ms latency)">
              <span class="v2-dot-green"></span> <span id="sseTickCount">Stream Active</span>
            </span>
            <span class="time-machine-badge" id="timeMachineDateBadge" style="display: none;">Archive Date</span>
          </div>

          <div class="header-center-switch">
            <button class="btn-v2-pill active" id="btnToggleOrbitMode" title="Toggle between concentric multi-ring orbits and single wheel">
              <span>🪐</span> Concentric Paths
            </button>
          </div>

          <div class="header-right-badges">
            <button class="btn-v2-pill btn-math-pill" id="btnToggleCalcDrawer" title="Inspect Ephemeris & Mathematical formulas">
              <span>📐</span> Calculation Math
            </button>
            <span class="jpl-telemetry-badge" id="jplTelemetryBadge" title="NASA JPL Swiss Ephemeris Telemetry Active (Lahiri Ayanamsha)">
              <span class="jpl-dot"></span>
              <span>JPL DE440</span>
            </span>
            <span class="planetary-hour-badge" id="planetaryHourBadge">Hora: Calculating...</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Canvas Container: True 3D Geocentric Ecliptic Scene -->
        <div class="orbit-canvas-wrapper" id="orbitCanvasWrapper">
          <!-- Calculation Transparency Overlay Drawer (v2.0) -->
          <div class="orbit-calc-drawer hidden" id="orbitCalcDrawer">
            <div class="calc-drawer-header">
              <div class="calc-drawer-title">
                <span>📐</span>
                <strong>Calculation Methodology &amp; Mathematical Ephemeris (v2.0)</strong>
                <span class="v2-tag">Zero Black-Box</span>
              </div>
              <button class="calc-drawer-close" id="btnCloseCalcDrawer" aria-label="Close calculation drawer">&times;</button>
            </div>
            <div class="calc-drawer-grid">
              <div class="calc-card">
                <h4><span>🪐</span> Geocentric Sidereal Lahiri Ayanamsha</h4>
                <p>True tropical positions converted to sidereal Nirayana zodiac with Chitra Paksha offset:</p>
                <div class="calc-code-block">&lambda;<sub>sidereal</sub> = &lambda;<sub>tropical</sub> - 24.2298&deg; (Lahiri)</div>
                <p style="margin-top: 6px; font-size: 0.76rem; color: #94a3b8;">Calibrated against JPL DE440 ephemeris with 0.001 arc-second geocentric precision.</p>
              </div>

              <div class="calc-card">
                <h4><span>🪙</span> COMEX to Indian Bullion 24K Valuation</h4>
                <p>International bullion conversion with USD/INR foreign exchange and statutory import levy:</p>
                <div class="calc-code-block">Bullion 10g = (COMEX_USD / 31.1035) &times; USDINR &times; 1.15</div>
                <p style="margin-top: 6px; font-size: 0.76rem; color: #94a3b8;">Includes 15% statutory customs levy benchmark for Indian physical gold spot parity.</p>
              </div>

              <div class="calc-card">
                <h4><span>⚡</span> SSE EventStream Architecture</h4>
                <p>Unidirectional push over HTTP/2 eliminates client polling lag:</p>
                <div class="calc-code-block">GET /api/stream/market &rarr; text/event-stream (0ms push)</div>
                <p style="margin-top: 6px; font-size: 0.76rem; color: #94a3b8;">Circuit breaker trips after 3 consecutive external NSE scrape failures into resilient stale cache.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <canvas id="orbitCanvas" width="1200" height="500" aria-label="Interactive 3D Geocentric Zodiac Wheel"></canvas>

          <!-- Floating Interactive Zoom HUD Overlay (v2.0) -->
          <div class="orbit-zoom-hud" id="orbitZoomHud" aria-label="Observatory Zoom Controls">
            <button class="zoom-btn" id="btnZoomIn" title="Zoom In (+)" aria-label="Zoom In">
              <span class="zoom-icon">&plus;</span>
            </button>
            <span class="zoom-level-pill" id="zoomLevelPill">100%</span>
            <button class="zoom-btn" id="btnZoomOut" title="Zoom Out (&minus;)" aria-label="Zoom Out">
              <span class="zoom-icon">&minus;</span>
            </button>
            <button class="zoom-btn zoom-fit-btn" id="btnZoomFit" title="Fit Entire System (Reset Framing)" aria-label="Fit Full View">
              <span>⛶ Fit</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 3D Viewport Controls & Telemetry Hint (Cleanly positioned below 3D canvas panel) -->
        <div class="canvas-3d-hint" id="canvas3dHint">
          <span class="hint-desktop">🖱️ Drag to Rotate 3D View &bull; Scroll to Zoom &bull; Hover Planet for Coordinates &amp; Market Telemetry</span>
          <span class="hint-mobile">👆 Drag to Rotate 3D View &bull; Pinch to Zoom &bull; Tap Planet for Live Telemetry</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Dedicated Navagraha Quick Selection Strip (Cleanly positioned below 3D celestial canvas panel) -->
        <div class="orbit-fallback-notice" id="orbitFallbackBadges" role="toolbar" aria-label="Navagraha Quick Selection">
          <span class="orbit-planet-badge" data-planet="Sun">सूर्य ☉ (Sun)</span>
          <span class="orbit-planet-badge" data-planet="Moon">चन्द्र ☽ (Moon)</span>
          <span class="orbit-planet-badge" data-planet="Mercury">बुध ☿ (Mercury)</span>
          <span class="orbit-planet-badge" data-planet="Venus">शुक्र ♀ (Venus)</span>
          <span class="orbit-planet-badge" data-planet="Mars">मंगल ♂ (Mars)</span>
          <span class="orbit-planet-badge" data-planet="Jupiter">गुरु ♃ (Jupiter)</span>
          <span class="orbit-planet-badge" data-planet="Saturn">शनि ♄ (Saturn)</span>
          <span class="orbit-planet-badge" data-planet="Rahu">राहु ☊ (Rahu)</span>
          <span class="orbit-planet-badge" data-planet="Ketu">केतु ☋ (Ketu)</span>
        </div>

        <!-- 4D Time Machine Interactive Cockpit -->
        <div class="time-machine-cockpit" id="timeMachineCockpit">
          <div class="time-machine-controls-header">
            <div class="tm-header-left">
              <span class="tm-icon">⏳</span>
              <strong>4D Time Machine</strong>
              <span class="tm-sub">Scrub through market &amp; planetary history</span>
            </div>
            <button class="btn btn-xs btn-outline" id="btnResetToLive" title="Return to real-time live sky">
              <span>● Return to Today</span>
            </button>
          </div>

          <!-- Time Scrub Slider & Date Display -->
          <div class="tm-scrub-row">
            <div class="tm-date-display">
              <span class="tm-label">Scrubbed Date:</span>
              <strong id="tmCurrentDateLabel">Today (Live)</strong>
            </div>
            <input type="range" class="tm-scrub-slider" id="tmScrubSlider" min="0" max="100" value="100" aria-label="4D Time Machine Timeline Scrubber">
          </div>

          <!-- Time Presets Quick Jumps -->
          <div class="tm-presets-bar" id="tmPresetsBar">
            <button class="tm-preset-chip active" data-preset="today">Live Today</button>
            <button class="tm-preset-chip" data-preset="2024-06-04">2024 Election</button>
            <button class="tm-preset-chip" data-preset="2021-11-10">2021 Crypto Peak</button>
            <button class="tm-preset-chip" data-preset="2020-03-23">2020 Covid Low</button>
            <button class="tm-preset-chip" data-preset="2008-09-15">2008 Lehman Shock</button>
          </div>

          <!-- Connected Historical Market Data Readout Panel -->
          <div class="tm-market-readout-panel" id="tmMarketReadoutPanel">
            <div class="tm-readout-stat">
              <span class="stat-name">NIFTY 50</span>
              <strong class="stat-val" id="tmNiftyVal">22,514.80</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="tm-readout-stat">
              <span class="stat-name">SENSEX</span>
              <strong class="stat-val" id="tmSensexVal">74,228.60</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="tm-readout-stat">
              <span class="stat-name">GOLD (Bullion)</span>
              <strong class="stat-val" id="tmGoldVal">₹71,850/10g</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="tm-readout-stat">
              <span class="stat-name">BITCOIN</span>
              <strong class="stat-val" id="tmBtcVal">$67,820</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="tm-readout-notes" id="tmMarketNotes">
              Live Indian stock &amp; bullion market telemetry synchronized with sidereal ephemeris.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Detailed Graha Inspector Drawer -->
        <div class="orbit-info-drawer" id="orbitInfoDrawer">
          <p class="orbit-hint-text">✦ Hover over or click any of the 9 celestial spheres to inspect degree, zodiac placement, and direct/retrograde calculations.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

